               (wz (a + 4096)) (wz needed) (wz (a + 6144)) (wz (a + 6128)) (wz (8 * q8)) x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x30 x31)
          F (Z_to_bv 64 0x4f2a8) fc None mE (seg_rom asegs)).
